# Allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include only what ships in the VSIX.
# vsce applies "!" re-includes after every exclude, regardless of order, so re-include
# precisely (dist/**/*.js, not dist/**) rather than excluding afterwards.
# Verify with: npx vsce ls --no-dependencies
**
!dist/**/*.js
!media/**
!package.json
!package.nls*.json
!l10n/**
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE.md
